elvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 20px;line-height: 150%;box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box !important;\">Everything K\u0101piti </strong>emails are sent by the <a href=\"https://www.kapiticoast.govt.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;color: #222222;font-weight: normal;text-decoration: underline;box-sizing: border-box !important;\">K\u0101piti Coast District Council</a> each week. It helps you stay connected&nbsp;with what's happening across the K\u0101piti Coast District.</p>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"mcnCaptionBlockInner\" style=\"padding: 9px;width: 100%;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\n        <div class=\"\" style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex;flex: 0 0 auto;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\n                <div class=\"mcnCaptionBottomImageContent\" style=\"padding: 0 9px 9px 9px;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex: 1 1 100%;align-self: flex-start;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\n                    \n                    \n\n                        <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/116502ad08e0b48f43720df24/images/d3924152-df9b-40a6-80d6-4261fe88b605.jpg\" width=\"1020\" style=\"align-self: center;max-width: 100%;box-shadow: none;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;border: 0;height: auto;outline: none;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;\" class=\"mcnImage\">\n                        \n            